// Editor agent parity allowlist (ADR-7307, crate docs of `regia_editor::agent_parity`).
// Every `.button(`, `.small_button(`, `menu_button(`, `selectable_label(`, `.checkbox(`, `Button::new(`,
// `ImageButton::new(`, `radio_value(`, `toggle_value(`, `glyph_button(` and `bare_checkbox(` site of
// non-test editor code that is not drawn through an `action_*` helper.
// class: method | command (via = the method or editor.command id), os_dialog (via = the method
// that takes the path), confirm (via = the method whose params state the choice), view_only,
// gap (changes state, no agent path yet; the scan fails on one not in its KNOWN_GAPS list).
// `text` is the key; `line` is informational.
// Refresh: REGIA_AGENT_PARITY_UPDATE=1 cargo test -p regia_editor --test agent_parity_scan
